            "verseId": "GAL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.1.16+ROM.1.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 1.16-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " For I would have you know, brethren, that the gospel which was preached by me is not man's",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Greek",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "according to man",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " gospel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I did not receive it from man, nor was I taught it, but it came through a revelation of Jesus Christ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.8.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 8.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " For you have heard of my former life in Judaism, how I persecuted the church of God violently and tried to destroy it; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.22.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 22.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and I advanced in Judaism beyond many of my own age among my people, so extremely zealous was I for the traditions of my fathers. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.9.1+ACT.9.2+ACT.9.3+ACT.9.4+ACT.9.5+ACT.9.6+ACT.9.7+ACT.9.8+ACT.9.9+ACT.9.10+ACT.9.11+ACT.9.12+ACT.9.13+ACT.9.14+ACT.9.15+ACT.9.16+ACT.9.17+ACT.9.18+ACT.9.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 9.1-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.49.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 49.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer 1.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " But when he who had set me apart before I was born, and had called me through his grace, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "was pleased to reveal his Son to",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Greek",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "in",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " me, in order that I might preach him among the Gentiles, I did not confer with flesh and blood, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nor did I go up to Jerusalem to those who were apostles before me, but I went away into Arabia; and again I returned to Damascus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
